<!-- OPENING -->
<tr>
<td style="padding:30px 30px 14px;">
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#263247;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 16px;">Dear Editorial Team,</p>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#263247;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 16px;">Your newsroom is invited to register for <strong>THE CODE</strong>, an international executive media programme taking place in New York from 6 to 8 October 2026.</p>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#263247;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 16px;">The organiser presents THE CODE as a <strong>first-of-its-kind international press conference</strong> combining the formal presentation of a multi-company international acquisition, the unveiling of a new global group and the live activation of THE CODE.</p>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#263247;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 16px;">Nermin Sefić is the Founder, Director and Ultimate Beneficial Owner (UBO) of GNK DINAMO Ltd. Group. Subject to completion of the announced mergers and acquisitions, and following activation of THE CODE on 7 October 2026, he is expected to become the largest individual beneficial owner of the newly formed group, with an ownership interest of approximately two thirds.</p>
<p style="font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.65;color:#263247;font-weight:400;margin:0 0 16px;">The programme is being prepared for <strong>more than 1,000 invited guests</strong> and representatives of <strong>over 200 media organisations from around the world</strong>.</p>
</td>
</tr>

